        "3d9ea84d-5527-4bce-abe6-5debef3ec955": {
          "type": "custom",
          "settings": {
            "open_tab_mobile": false,
            "title": "Shipping & Return",
            "type": "all",
            "content": "<h2>Shipping & Delivery</h2>\nLast Updated: February 2026\n\nThank you for shopping at Leathery.pro! Our sole aim is to deliver your premium leather goods efficiently and securely, nationwide or anywhere around the world.\n\n<h3>1. Processing Orders</h3>\nOnce your order and payment are confirmed, we begin processing it within 1 to 2 business days. You will receive a confirmation email with order details and anticipated dispatch timing.\n\n<h3>2. Shipping Methods</h3>\nOur shipping options are based on your location:\n\nDomestic (Pakistan): Standard courier service\n\nInternational: Selected international shipping through trusted courier partners\n\nDelivery times vary and depend on your location and shipping option selected at checkout.\n\n<h3>3. Delivery Timeline</h3>\nThe delivery timeline varies accordingly:\n\nPakistan: 3 to 7 business days\n\nInternational: 10 to 21 business days (custom charges and destination location applicable)\n\nThere may be delays due to customs clearance, local holidays, or carrier disruptions.\n\n<h3>4. Shipping Charges</h3>\nShipping fees are calculated at checkout based on your residence, location, weight of the package, and selected service level.\n\nFree shipping is applicable on orders over PKR 5000 for nationwide delivery.\n\nDiscounts may apply during certain promotions.\n\n<h3>5. Tracking Your Order</h3>\nOnce we dispatch your order, you will receive a tracking number through email or text message. You can use this tracking number to track your delivery status in real time.\n\n<h3>6. Customs, Duties and Taxes</h3>\nFor international orders, customs duties and import taxes may apply in your country. These charges are the responsibility of the recipient unless otherwise specified.\n\n<h3>7. Failed Delivery and Returns</h3>\nSometimes a shipment may return to us due to wrong address, failed delivery attempts, or refusal at customs, for which additional charges may apply to resend the package. \n\nYou can contact our customer support for assistance.\n\n<h3>8. Damaged or Lost Shipments</h3>\nIf your order arrives damaged or is lost during delivery:\n\nClick photos of the package and its contents\n\nContact us within 3 days of delivery\n\nWe will help settle any disputes with the courier service and arrange a replacement or refund, if applicable.\n\n<h3>9. Contact Information</h3>\nFor shipping queries, tracking shipment, or delivery support: Email: leathery.pro@hotmail.com\n\nBusiness Hours: Monday to Saturday | 9:00 AM to 6:00 PM (PKT)",
            "product_custom_source": "dynamic",
            "product_tab_key_metafield": "",
            "enable_btn_show_more": false,
            "maximum_des_to_show": 300
          }
        },
